OL,3,GNEWSAElgin man found after going
OL,4,Amissing in Rome on first night of
OL,5,Aholiday
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 56-year-old man from Moray who went
OL,8,Fmissing in Rome on the first night of
OL,9,Fhis holiday has been found, according
OL,10,Fto his family.
OL,12,FColin Ross had just arrived in the
OL,13,FItalian capital with partner Anabella
OL,14,FMcallister, when he disappeared up a
OL,15,Fside street near the Pantheon at about
OL,16,F22:00 on Friday evening.
OL,18,FPosting on social media, Mcallister
OL,19,Fsaid Ross, from Elgin, had become
OL,20,Funsteady due to his medication and the
OL,21,Fheat, and did not have his phone or
OL,22,Fwallet with him.
OL,23,APub: 16-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNews IndexCNat NewsFHeadlines
